                                "    text: \u001b[32m\"I loved that That was a great demonstration I did with another group We did that years later It didn't turn out so well But but I thought that was a very important demonstration because I think uh the Catholic church didn't I guess it was Cardinal o'connor at the time\"\u001b[39m,",
